Package: cranprobe
Title: Probe for CRAN Special Checks
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person("Probe", "Author", email = "probe@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Deliberately corrupts a constant, writes into its own installation directory, and ships invalid HTML, so that the checks meant to catch each can be shown to.
